---
import SectionHead from "./SectionHead.astro";
---

<section class="section wrap" id="about">
  <SectionHead label="About" no="01" title="By day, by night." />
  <div class="panels">
    <article class="panel day">
      <p class="label tag">
        <svg
          aria-hidden="true"
          fill="none"
          height="16"
          stroke="currentColor"
          stroke-linecap="round"
          stroke-width="2"
          viewBox="0 0 24 24"
          width="16"
        >
          <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="4"></circle>
          <path d="M12 2v2M12 20v2M4.9 4.9l1.4 1.4M17.7 17.7l1.4 1.4M2 12h2M20 12h2M4.9 19.1l1.4-1.4M17.7 6.3l1.4-1.4"
          ></path>
        </svg>
        By day
        <span class="here">you are here</span>
      </p>
      <h3>IT Manager keeping Tier‑1 semiconductor operations online.</h3>
      <p class="long">
        Two decades in semiconductor manufacturing, from developing C# solutions on the factory floor to directing the
        enterprise systems a Tier‑1 operation runs on. I've seen what happens when integration fails at scale, and I've
        built the infrastructure to make sure it doesn't.
      </p>
      <p>
        Today I lead a team of <b>10 developers</b>, and I'm bringing AI into how we work. Where security and compliance
        come first, that means starting with approved tools, proving value on real tasks, and building habits the team
        can keep — not chasing every new model.
      </p>
    </article>

    <p class="bridge"><span aria-hidden="true" class="arrow"></span> what survives</p>

    <article class="panel night">
      <p class="label tag">
        <svg
          aria-hidden="true"
          fill="none"
          height="16"
          stroke="currentColor"
          stroke-linecap="round"
          stroke-linejoin="round"
          stroke-width="2"
          viewBox="0 0 24 24"
          width="16"
        >
          <path d="M20 14.5A8.5 8.5 0 0 1 9.5 4a8.5 8.5 0 1 0 10.5 10.5z"></path>
        </svg>
        By night
        <span class="here">you are here</span>
      </p>
      <h3>Building with Claude Code, Claude, Gemini and ChatGPT.</h3>
      <p>
        Automating my own work first, then bringing what works to my team. My personal lab is where things get tried
        before anyone else has to live with them: agents, review workflows, a knowledge system.
      </p>
      <p class="long">
        And one AI lobster I eventually let go.
        <a href="/blog/lobster-ep1-week-one/">Read the lobster series <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
      </p>
    </article>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .panels {
    position: relative;
    display: grid;
    gap: 16px;
  }
  .panel {
    padding: clamp(24px, 4vw, 40px);
    border-radius: 20px;
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
  }
  /* 兩塊的顏色固定：白天永遠是淺色、晚上永遠是深色，不跟著主題反轉 */
  .day {
    --p-ink: #14213d;
    --p-muted: #55607a;
    --p-accent: #2447d8;
    background: var(--day-bg);
    color: var(--p-ink);
  }
  .night {
    --p-ink: #eef1f8;
    --p-muted: #a3aec6;
    --p-accent: #8fb0ff;
    background: var(--night-bg);
    color: var(--p-ink);
  }
  .tag {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
    margin: 0 0 20px;
    color: var(--p-muted);
  }
  .here {
    display: none;
    margin-left: auto;
    padding: 2px 8px;
    border-radius: 999px;
    background: #ffc53d;
    color: #14213d;
  }
  :global([data-theme="day"]) .day .here,
  :global([data-theme="night"]) .night .here {
    display: inline-block;
  }
  h3 {
    margin-bottom: 16px;
    font-weight: 800;
    font-size: clamp(1.375rem, 1.1rem + 1.2vw, 1.875rem);
    line-height: 1.15;
    letter-spacing: -0.015em;
    text-wrap: balance;
  }
  .panel p:not(.tag) {
    margin: 0 0 12px;
    color: var(--p-muted);
  }
  .panel p:last-child {
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }
  .panel b {
    color: var(--p-ink);
  }
  .panel a {
    color: var(--p-accent);
    font-weight: 600;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }
  .panel a:hover {
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-underline-offset: 3px;
  }
  /* 晚上試過、活下來的，帶到白天：箭頭從晚上指向白天 */
  .bridge {
    justify-self: center;
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
    margin: -6px 0;
    padding: 6px 14px;
    border-radius: 999px;
    background: var(--sun);
    color: var(--sun-ink);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }
  .arrow::before {
    content: "↑";
  }
  /* 手機精簡：每塊只留標題與一段，其餘（.long）收起來 */
  @media (max-width: 639px) {
    .panels {
      gap: 12px;
    }
    .panel {
      padding: 20px;
    }
    .tag {
      margin-bottom: 12px;
    }
    h3 {
      margin-bottom: 10px;
    }
    .panel p.long {
      display: none;
    }
    .panel p:nth-last-child(2) {
      margin-bottom: 0;
    }
  }
  @media (min-width: 900px) {
    .panels {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
      gap: 24px;
    }
    .bridge {
      position: absolute;
      z-index: 1;
      top: 0;
      left: 50%;
      margin: 0;
      transform: translate(-50%, -50%);
    }
    .arrow::before {
      content: "←";
    }
  }
</style>
